# Auth is via the App Store Connect API key set up in the Fastfile (api_key
# lane variable) -- match never needs an Apple ID/password either.

# DEDICATED REPO, deliberately. match re-encrypts the ENTIRE certificates
# repo with whatever MATCH_PASSWORD the running project supplies, so two
# projects sharing one repo will silently lock each other out -- this exact
# failure hit remi on 2026-08-26/28 when a drobe build re-encrypted their
# shared repo, and surfaced as the misleading "Invalid password passed via
# 'MATCH_PASSWORD'". email-app gets its own repo, its own MATCH_PASSWORD,
# and its own deploy key. Never point this at remi-ios-certs.
